{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sendian","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sendian-arada-properties-tilal","about":"Sendian is the first residential community in Masaar, a new development by Arada Developer and offers a mix of townhouses and villas in Sharjah. Here, you can choose from 2, 3 &amp; 4 bedroom townhouses as 4 and 5 Bedroom Park villas, as 4 bedroom semi-detached villas that are designed to let you and your family thrive and live in the midst of absolute comfort.The nature-inspired homes are surrounded by an abundance of green spaces. Each of the units offers direct access to a park. Moreover, the serene setting is perfect for you to relax and unwind. Made available with an attractive payment plan, the family-oriented units come equipped with smart home features as standard. These units situated right in the heart of this gated residential community, the development also features a community centre offering a host of activities. Children, in particular, will have a safe and secured environment, where they will get an opportunity to explore the world and have a great time.The homes come in a warm-toned or cool-toned colour scheme. When it comes to the interiors and the overall layout, the design and use of contemporary elements present a whole new dimension of living.For a project of this size and scale, it does meet the highest possible construction standards and promotes the virtue of smart and sustainable living.","price":2000000,"title":"Sendian","bitrix":{"id":940,"pf_id":"are.3.11335","source":null,"project_id":"Masaar","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sendian","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Arada Developments","project_location":"Tilal City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/340x252/bElZ8yDrwgfqwzGC17ogqlucd5LptBYpBQUZtSky.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off